     1,
     "Hello Ricardo, I think the error you are getting is because you don&#39;t have the dependencies. They are shown at <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ng7nObsTdS9UvGb0chJj3\">http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html</a><div>\n<a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/ggplot2/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Ng7nObsTdS9UvGb0chJj3\"></a>According to this you need to have the following packages in order to get ggplot2 to work: <span style=\"font-family:&#39;Times New Roman&#39;;font-size:medium\"><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/reshape/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:white;color:blue;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/reshape/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ENP-VN_DefHLUU63M9mjo\">reshape</a> (≥ 0.8.0), <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/plyr/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:white;color:blue;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/plyr/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw057_4AcSSfJykL9KQG0XZy\">plyr</a> (≥ 0.1.8), splines, <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/MASS/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:white;color:blue;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/MASS/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3U9_EpRYxA65O4Vj8-jlmc\">MASS</a>, <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RColorBrewer/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:white;color:blue;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/RColorBrewer/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw19zmvOFYMolQGCjgRsj2tm\">RColorBrewer</a>, grid, <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/proto/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:white;color:blue;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/proto/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3wQeIFpksSm4BsU_G5zOMC\">proto</a>, <a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/digest/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:white;color:blue;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/digest/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jQsxxjAC1GU8xJPRbcFMk\">digest</a></span></div>\n<div><font face=\"&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\"><br></span></font></div>\n<div><a href=\"http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/digest/index.html\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;background-color:white;color:blue;background-position:initial initial;background-repeat:initial initial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/digest/index.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792383756950000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2jQsxxjAC1GU8xJPRbcFMk\"></a><font face=\"&#39;Times New Roman&#39;\"><span style=\"font-size:medium\">I hope that helps<br clear=\"all\">\n</span></font>Luciano<br>\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2010/3/24 rickyars <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rick...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"></blockquote></div></div>"
